{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789825178256,"sessionID":"ses_f462a6b74ffedf3OBDp51fgDmj","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e4da070010Fo65jegCwHDFQ","sessionID":"ses_f462a6b74ffedf3OBDp51fgDmj","messageID":"msg_0b9e4cf62001l6xYE7XtiUX7DN","type":"tool","id":"call_00_n3DWZhc3jkGBT5dd8AgG5650","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /tmp/opencode/petsmart && grep -n \"6 IOI submitters\" build_ledger.py"},"output":"301:    terms=(\"Disjoint residual cohort: 6 IOI submitters minus the three individually recorded (Buyer Group, R018; Unnamed financial bidder 1, R019; Bidder 2, R020) = 3 remaining submitters. By count these comprise the third bidder that initially indicated at or above $80.00 (no individual price or name disclosed) and two submitters whose prices were below the final-round threshold. Prices not disclosed for the cohort; no endpoints invented.\"),\n313:    terms=(\"Inferred: residual \\u2014 15 NDA signers \\u2212 6 IOI submitters = 9 non-submitters. J.P. Morgan called all potential bidders including non-submitters on 10/30-11/02 to hear their reasons, so the filing accounts for their non-participation. No decision date, motive, identity or permanent withdrawal is inferred; a non-submitter may appear again in a later stage only with a Re-entered row.\"),\n345:    terms=(\"Inferred: residual \\u2014 6 IOI submitters \\u2212 4 advancing at or above $80.00 = 2 eliminated submitters, being the two members of R021 whose indications did not reach the threshold (the third member advanced within the unnamed finalists). J.P. Morgan notified the eliminated parties; none indicated any interest or ability to remain above its initial indications. Exclusion from the final round only; no motive or identity inferred.\"),\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"301:    terms=(\"Disjoint residual cohort: 6 IOI submitters minus the three individually recorded (Buyer Group, R018; Unnamed financial bidder 1, R019; Bidder 2, R020) = 3 remaining submitters. By count these comprise the third bidder that initially indicated at or above $80.00 (no individual price or name disclosed) and two submitters whose prices were below the final-round threshold. Prices not disclosed for the cohort; no endpoints invented.\"),\n313:    terms=(\"Inferred: residual \\u2014 15 NDA signers \\u2212 6 IOI submitters = 9 non-submitters. J.P. Morgan called all potential bidders including non-submitters on 10/30-11/02 to hear their reasons, so the filing accounts for their non-participation. No decision date, motive, identity or permanent withdrawal is inferred; a non-submitter may appear again in a later stage only with a Re-entered row.\"),\n345:    terms=(\"Inferred: residual \\u2014 6 IOI submitters \\u2212 4 advancing at or above $80.00 = 2 eliminated submitters, being the two members of R021 whose indications did not reach the threshold (the third member advanced within the unnamed finalists). J.P. Morgan notified the eliminated parties; none indicated any interest or ability to remain above its initial indications. Exclusion from the final round only; no motive or identity inferred.\"),\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode/petsmart && grep -n \\\"6 IOI submitters\\\" build_ledger.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825178119,"end":1789825178256}}}}
