{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789825190248,"sessionID":"ses_f462a6b74ffedf3OBDp51fgDmj","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e5086200125Rp8eq2pY8Nvi","sessionID":"ses_f462a6b74ffedf3OBDp51fgDmj","messageID":"msg_0b9e4f992001Kk801DmSA4y68w","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ET_lPSAlxK3w2iU36JuEq2G7867","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /tmp/opencode/petsmart && grep -n \"R011\\|R013\\|R014, R021\\|R011, R013\" build_xlsx.py | head; grep -n \"reason Lower offer than rivals\" build_xlsx.py"},"output":"193:s('Initiation assessment', \"Mixed - target-led exploration by the board and the ad hoc committee, following activist pressure (JANA, Longview) and inbound interest (Industry Participant's 08/07/2014 approach and 27 contacts), with the 08/19/2014 public announcement deliberately used to widen the field. Sequence: R001-R013 (round 0), then R014 (round 1 opening).\", '')\n206:s('Round 1 (Round opened row R014) - Not final', \"Anchor: the confidentiality-agreement wave (R015); rejected candidate anchors kept as rows: R008 (08/13 decision), R009 (08/19 announcement), R013 (10/03 board update). Scope: 15 financial NDA signers; October diligence, management presentations and Profit Improvement Plan access; non-binding IOIs due 10/30/2014 (R016, R017). Round-bidder tally: 6 submitting units (R018-R021; Bidder 2's revision R023 carries Count 0).\", '')\n209:s('Deadline history and treatment', \"10/30/2014 IOIs (R017) - Enforced: six submissions, J.P. Morgan feedback calls 10/30-11/02, board advanced four on 11/03. 12/05/2014 final bids (on R027) - Extended: superseded 12/04-05 before arrival and moved by R029; no milestone row. 12/10/2014 final bids (R030) - Extended: bids received; committee moved the deadline to 12/12 by R036. 12/12/2014 improved bids (R037) - Enforced: best-and-final offers received; board acted 12/13. No 'Late bids accepted' case; round 2 has no submission deadline; 'No deadline stated' does not apply. Earlier R1 anchors rejected: R008, R009, R013.\", '')\n221:s('Industry Participant', \"Unnamed privately held industry participant. PetSmart's own approach in Spring 2014 (R001); inbound approach 08/07/2014 (R007); excluded from the process on 08/22-27/2014, reaffirmed 10/03/2014 (R010, R013). Never entered - no NDA or bid; no outcome row.\", '')\n291: \"Recommended: one process (2014 sale process); R1 anchored on the first-week-of-October confidentiality wave (R015), not the 08/13 decision, 08/19 announcement or 10/03 board update (all retained as rows R008/R009/R013 so the boundary can move). R2 opens with the 11/03 advancement (Inferred final); R3 opens with the November request for 'final bids' (Announced as final); the 12/04-05 and 12/10-12 events are deadline revisions inside R3, not new rounds. Keep R1 'Not final' (preliminary IOI stage).\",\n305: \"R011, R015, R018-R021, R023, R024, R025; Summary counts block\",\n329: \"R011, R014, R015, R022, R023, R026, R027, R028, R035; Date fields\",\n309: \"Recommended: (a) 10/30/2014 - 9 unnamed NDA signers Did not submit, Inferred: residual (15 NDA signers - 6 submitters), Count 9, Decided by Unknown, reason Not stated (R022); (b) 11/03/2014 - 2 unnamed submitters Dropped by target, Inferred: residual (6 submitters - 4 advancing), Count 2, Decided by Target, reason Lower offer than rivals (R025); (c) by 12/10/2014 - Unnamed financial bidder 1, Count-0 identity row (recommended reading: closed inside Bidder 3; R035). Stated comparators: Bidder 3 Did not submit (R034) and Bidder 2 Not selected at signing (R045). No identities, motives or permanent withdrawals are inferred.\",\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"193:s('Initiation assessment', \"Mixed - target-led exploration by the board and the ad hoc committee, following activist pressure (JANA, Longview) and inbound interest (Industry Participant's 08/07/2014 approach and 27 contacts), with the 08/19/2014 public announcement deliberately used to widen the field. Sequence: R001-R013 (round 0), then R014 (round 1 opening).\", '')\n206:s('Round 1 (Round opened row R014) - Not final', \"Anchor: the confidentiality-agreement wave (R015); rejected candidate anchors kept as rows: R008 (08/13 decision), R009 (08/19 announcement), R013 (10/03 board update). Scope: 15 financial NDA signers; October diligence, management presentations and Profit Improvement Plan access; non-binding IOIs due 10/30/2014 (R016, R017). Round-bidder tally: 6 submitting units (R018-R021; Bidder 2's revision R023 carries Count 0).\", '')\n209:s('Deadline history and treatment', \"10/30/2014 IOIs (R017) - Enforced: six submissions, J.P. Morgan feedback calls 10/30-11/02, board advanced four on 11/03. 12/05/2014 final bids (on R027) - Extended: superseded 12/04-05 before arrival and moved by R029; no milestone row. 12/10/2014 final bids (R030) - Extended: bids received; committee moved the deadline to 12/12 by R036. 12/12/2014 improved bids (R037) - Enforced: best-and-final offers received; board acted 12/13. No 'Late bids accepted' case; round 2 has no submission deadline; 'No deadline stated' does not apply. Earlier R1 anchors rejected: R008, R009, R013.\", '')\n221:s('Industry Participant', \"Unnamed privately held industry participant. PetSmart's own approach in Spring 2014 (R001); inbound approach 08/07/2014 (R007); excluded from the process on 08/22-27/2014, reaffirmed 10/03/2014 (R010, R013). Never entered - no NDA or bid; no outcome row.\", '')\n291: \"Recommended: one process (2014 sale process); R1 anchored on the first-week-of-October confidentiality wave (R015), not the 08/13 decision, 08/19 announcement or 10/03 board update (all retained as rows R008/R009/R013 so the boundary can move). R2 opens with the 11/03 advancement (Inferred final); R3 opens with the November request for 'final bids' (Announced as final); the 12/04-05 and 12/10-12 events are deadline revisions inside R3, not new rounds. Keep R1 'Not final' (preliminary IOI stage).\",\n305: \"R011, R015, R018-R021, R023, R024, R025; Summary counts block\",\n329: \"R011, R014, R015, R022, R023, R026, R027, R028, R035; Date fields\",\n309: \"Recommended: (a) 10/30/2014 - 9 unnamed NDA signers Did not submit, Inferred: residual (15 NDA signers - 6 submitters), Count 9, Decided by Unknown, reason Not stated (R022); (b) 11/03/2014 - 2 unnamed submitters Dropped by target, Inferred: residual (6 submitters - 4 advancing), Count 2, Decided by Target, reason Lower offer than rivals (R025); (c) by 12/10/2014 - Unnamed financial bidder 1, Count-0 identity row (recommended reading: closed inside Bidder 3; R035). Stated comparators: Bidder 3 Did not submit (R034) and Bidder 2 Not selected at signing (R045). No identities, motives or permanent withdrawals are inferred.\",\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode/petsmart && grep -n \\\"R011\\\\|R013\\\\|R014, R021\\\\|R011, R013\\\" build_xlsx.py | head; grep -n \\\"reason Lower offer than rivals\\\" build_xlsx.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825189986,"end":1789825190248}}}}
