R045). No identities, motives or permanent withdrawals are inferred.\",\n+ \"Recommended: (a) 10/30/2014 - 9 unnamed NDA signers Did not submit, Inferred: residual (15 NDA signers - 6 submitters), Count 9, Decided by Unknown, reason Not stated (R022); (b) 11/03/2014 - 2 unnamed submitters Dropped by target, Inferred: residual (6 submitters - 4 advancing), Count 2, Decided by Target, Exit reason Not stated (the lower-price context is preserved in Terms; R025); (c) by 12/10/2014 - Unnamed financial bidder 1, Count-0 identity row (recommended reading: closed inside Bidder 3; R035). Stated comparators: Bidder 3 Did not submit (R034) and Bidder 2 Not selected at signing (R045). No identities, motives or permanent withdrawals are inferred.\",\n  \"Instruction's closing rules: residual non-submissions by subtraction; eliminations by residual at the advancement; a named-but-silent party gets a Count-0 identity row naming the covering cohort; stated outcomes take no opener. Arithmetic and passages: P-010, P-012, P-013; covering rows R021, R026, R034.\",\n  \"R022, R025, R035 (plus stated R034, R045); Summary balance\",\n  \"Changing a base (e.g., fewer eligible signers) changes the residual counts and the inferred share of the per-stage balance; re-labelling the two eliminees as a different cohort changes the count of stated outcomes but not the total exits.\",\n  'Pending',''),\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited /tmp/opencode/petsmart/build_xlsx.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"Count 2, Decided by Target, Exit reason Not stated (the lower-price context is preserved in Terms; R025);\", \"oldString\": \"Count 2, Decided by Target, reason Lower offer than rivals (R025);\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/petsmart/build_xlsx.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825199100,"end":1789825199485}}}}
